{"full":"hf:EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","spaceId":"EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","name":"Look Who's Talking","source":"huggingface","description":"In a group, Reachy looks at whoever is talking. 100% local.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","reachy_mini","reachy_mini_python_app","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":6,"created":"2026-08-03T17:29:48.000Z","updated":"2026-10-15T16:14:57.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://eryrilabs-look-whos-talking.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.643Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.643Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.643Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"👀","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Reachy Mini looks at whoever is talking — like a real listener.","Put two or three people in front of Reachy and start chatting. It holds natural eye contact with whoever is speaking, switches attention the way a good listener does (no ping-ponging), glances at the others during silences, does a tiny acknowledgment nod when a new person takes over, and stays subtly alive the whole time — micro-saccades, breathing sway, antenna perks.","100% local. No API keys. No cloud. Vision (the daemon's own YuNet face detector) fuses with the mic array's hardware direction-of-arrival + speech detection. Works on Lite and Wireless; degrades gracefully when hardware features are missing (camera-only lip-motion mode works fine)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d8813e4f69ce045e81c596725c0d25709ffefa0154ad0f639b5ab305e033ed69","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.700Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.700Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Reachy Mini looks at whoever is talking — like a real listener.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No GPU, no accounts, no keys.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d8813e4f69ce045e81c596725c0d25709ffefa0154ad0f639b5ab305e033ed69","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.700Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T16:14:57.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:42.700Z","hash":"d8813e4f69ce045e81c596725c0d25709ffefa0154ad0f639b5ab305e033ed69","originalBytes":3203,"storedBytes":3203,"truncated":false},"subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T16:15:48.788Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T16:15:48.788Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-16T16:15:48.788Z","target":"https://eryrilabs-look-whos-talking.static.hf.space/index.html","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T16:15:48.788Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T16:15:48.788Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T16:15:48.788Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T16:15:48.788Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/05a4b30c15416b0936e3a427.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T16:15:48.788Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking"}],"quali